WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
[Music] Video Studio — From Nodes to Narrative.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
A wind-up robot sequence demonstrates prompt-led motion and generated sound.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.000
The model catalog presents 16 recipes across four model families.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
A native-HD Wan 2.2 5B sequence shows a truck moving through sunflowers.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
